title: The Mark Falls
subtitle: The dollar passes two hundred and fifty marks.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1921 and month = 11 and crisis = 0 and congress = 0
max-visits: 1
priority: 6
on-arrival: {!
Q.inflation += 4;
RG.news('The dollar passes 250 marks: hunger riots in Berlin', 3);
!}

= The Mark Falls

In January a dollar cost sixty-five marks. In November it costs more than two hundred and fifty. Bread, potatoes and coal rise week by week, and the wage agreements signed in the spring are worth less every Friday. Hugo Stinnes, who borrowed in marks to buy mines and newspapers, grows richer by the day. In Berlin shops are plundered.

[? if e21_real_values = 1 : The union branches in Saxony and Thuringia have dug out our demand of May for the seizure of real values. They want to know if the party still means it. ?]

- @real_values: Take the seizure of real values to the unions.
- @committees: Form price control committees in the factories.
- @hunger: Lead the hunger marches in Berlin.

@real_values
view-if: e21_real_values = 1
subtitle: [? if lock_union_work = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] The demand we made in May, now that the workers can see the point of it.
choose-if: lock_union_work < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids work inside the reformist unions.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_union_work == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.worker_support += 5;
Q.spd_relation += 4;
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
RG.comply(15);
RG.ledger('The party\'s demand for the seizure of real values was taken up by the unions in the inflation of 1921.', 'e21_real_values');
!}

Brandler's people carry the demand into the ADGB branches of Saxony and Thuringia, where it passes at meeting after meeting. The ADGB leaders say it is worth discussing, which is more than they have ever said about any demand of ours.

@committees
subtitle: [? if lock_councils = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Workers and housewives check the prices themselves.
choose-if: lock_councils < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids council action.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_councils == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.worker_support += 3;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
!}

Control committees of workers and housewives visit the markets and warehouses. They find hoarded potatoes and post the hoarders' names on the factory notice boards.

@hunger
subtitle: The unemployed will march behind our banners. The Berlin police are waiting for them.
on-arrival: {!
RG.district('berlin', {militancy: 8, repression: 8, loyalty: 5});
RG.startStrike('berlin');
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
!}

Columns of the unemployed march on the Berlin city hall behind our banners. Windows are broken, and so are heads.
